.TH "CHECK_TICKER" "1" "April 2026" "NMS_Tools" "Deterministic Ticker Movement Monitoring"
.hy
.SH NAME
.PP
\f[B]check_ticker\f[R] \[em] deterministic ticker ingestion and movement
analysis tool
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
\f[B]check_ticker\f[R] \[en]symbol \[en]json \[en]verbose \[en]quiet
.PD 0
.P
.PD
\f[B]check_ticker\f[R] \[en]debug-ticker \[en]timeout
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
\f[B]check_ticker\f[R] retrieves ticker movement data from a backend
source and evaluates deterministic movement thresholds, volatility
scoring, and trend indicators.
The tool is designed for dashboards, monitoring systems, and backend
ingestion validation.
.PP
Movement calculations are deterministic and consistent across
executions.
.SH OPTIONS
.SS \[en]symbol 
.PP
Ticker symbol to evaluate.
.PD 0
.P
.PD
Examples: \f[V]AAPL\f[R], \f[V]MSFT\f[R], \f[V]TSLA\f[R].
.SS \[en]json
.PP
Emit deterministic JSON output.
.SS \[en]verbose
.PP
Emit human\[u2011]readable verbose output.
.SS \[en]quiet
.PP
Emit minimal Nagios\[u2011]style output.
.SS \[en]debug-ticker
.PP
Display backend fetch lifecycle, timing, and normalization details.
.SS \[en]timeout 
.PP
Set execution timeout.
.SS \[en]help
.PP
Show help text.
